# Model Selection

- Always use the **Auto** model for this project and for any subagents/tasks.
- Never use Grok (or "agrook") models, including: `grok-*`, `cursor-grok-*`, or any Grok variant.
- When spawning subagents, set model to `inherit` (Auto) — do not pick a different model unless the user explicitly asks for a non-Grok model by name.
